response:
The agent prompt runs even when `--dir` is set, though `--dir` should override agent selection. The fix has two parts: `resolveHosts` returns early when `opts.Dir` is set, and `buildInstallPlans` creates a single plan for that directory instead of deriving one per selected host. I also made `formatPlanHosts` return a readable label when there are no hosts, so the messages don't read "for .". I haven't compiled or run this.

